"view.prenatal.results.help"            = "Each row shows a prenatal astronomical event and when it becomes effective in the person's life.\n\n'Actual date': the projected life date derived from the conversion formula.\n'Prenatal date': when the event occurred during gestation.\n\nFor aspects the two factors and the aspect glyph are shown with their positions.\nFor eclipses, ingresses, and stations only one factor is shown.\n\nSelect a row in the prenatal table and a row in the Events list, then click 'Combine' to correct the conception date. Click 'Reset' to return to the standard conception date.";

